<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11952] Bug fixes and improvements in console utilities &amp; test fixes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11952</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Contains the following fixes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;U.currentTimeMillis() must not be used for timeouts calculation in Discovery and Communication SPI&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;control.sh --baseline shows incorrect information&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;control.sh print unclear message (secured cluster)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Client disconnect detection time linearly depends on number of network interfaces of remote node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Various improvements in javadocs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
